---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import avatar from "../assets/images/avatar.png";
---

<div id="left-intro">
<div id="intro-heading">
  Hi, I'm <span class="accent">Marina</span>.
  <span id="sub-heading">I make complex software easier to understand.</span>
</div>
  <div id="intro-description">
<p>
  I'm currently a <strong>Senior UX Writer</strong> at Turnitin, specializing in technical documentation, software user guides, and knowledge bases. I create clear, practical documentation that helps people navigate complex systems and solve problems independently.
</p>  
</div>
</div>

<div id="right-intro">
  <div id="intro-image">
    <Image src={avatar} alt="A graphic of Marina" />
  </div>
</div>
